  "thag1.44:1.1": "4 mataṃ vā amma rodanti ",
  "thag1.44:1.2": "yo vā jīvaṃ na dissati ",
  "thag1.44:1.3": "jīvantaṃ maṃ amma dissanti ",
  "thag1.44:1.4": "kasmā maṃ amma rodasīti. ",
  "thag1.44:1.5": "sānu thero. "
